              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_hiw001": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How It Works",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_hiw001": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Choose your credential, your size, and your color, then make it truly yours with custom text.</p><p>Custom text is required and included at no extra cost. Most people add their name, but this is your quarter-zip: add a nickname, a class year, your unit, a motivational word, or a loved one's name.</p><p>Every piece is made to order, never sitting in a warehouse, never mass-produced. We digitize and embroider each design in-house using commercial-grade thread and the highest quality materials, so the stitching is as durable as the career it represents. No heat transfers, no screen printing, no shortcuts. <a href=\"/pages/about\" title=\"About\">Learn more about who we are and our values.</a></p><p>Have questions? Our <a href=\"/pages/faq\" title=\"FAQ\">FAQ</a> covers the most common ones.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
