                "accordion_row_rp001": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns Policy",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_rp001": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<h5><strong>Quarter-Zips Without Custom Text:</strong></h5><p>If you're not completely happy, you can return your item within 14 days of delivery in unworn, unwashed, original condition.  <strong>Return shipping is the customer's responsibility. </strong>Review our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund / Return policy</a> for full details.</p><h5><strong>Quarter-Zips With Custom Text:</strong></h5><p>Because your quarter-zip was embroidered specifically with your personalization, all custom text orders are <strong>final sale with no returns or exchanges. </strong>Please double check your custom text before completing your order, we embroider exactly what you submit. We are not responsible for misspellings or incorrectly entered names or details. Review our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund / Return policy</a> for full details.</p><h5><strong>Defects or Our Errors</strong></h5><p>If something arrives damaged or defective, we'll make it right. See our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund & Return Policy</a> for how to reach us and what to expect.</p>",
